[
  {"comment": "A modelled internal thread over a part of a bore with an end chamfer, with and without a radial clearance (mitcad#628). A rod of 60 mm from z = 47.432 to 73.432 (Sketch1 F1, Extrude1 F2) bored through at 42.266 mm (Sketch2 F3, Extrude2 F4)."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_circle", "sketch": "F1", "center": [0, 0], "diameter": 60},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F1", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "start": {"type": "offset", "offset": 47.432}, "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 26},
    "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_circle", "sketch": "F3", "center": [0, 0], "diameter": 42.266},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F3", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "through_all"}, "operation": "cut", "participants": ["F2.b0"]}},

  {"comment": "M48x5 6H modelled with the class's diameters (the minor one on the bore), 22.888 long 3.112 from the low end of the bore's axis, which points down from the top (z = 73.432), the end (the bottom, z = 47.432) chamfered to 45 mm at 45 degrees (Thread1 F5). The crest lies on the bore, pieces of which stay: the thread runs from z = 73.432 - 3.112 = 70.32 down to where the cone meets the bore, (45 - 42.266) / 2 = 1.367 above the bottom."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "thread", "faces": [{"body": "F2.b0", "face": "F4:side(c1)"}],
    "thread": {"designation": "M48x5", "class": "6H"}, "modeled": true,
    "diameters": {"major": 47.92, "minor": 42.266, "pitch": 45.14},
    "location": "low_end", "offset": 3.112, "length": 22.888, "chamfer": "end", "chamfer_diameter": 45,
    "angle": "31.1 deg"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Thread1", "status": "ok"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F2.b0", "has_face": "F5:thread_chamfer_high(F4:side(c1))"}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "threads"}, "result": [{"feature": "F5", "face": "F4:side(c1)", "modeled": true,
    "internal": true, "radius": 21.133, "start": [0, 0, 70.32], "end": [0, 0, 48.799]}]}},

  {"comment": "With a radial and a flank clearance of 0.05 the crest (21.183) lies off the bore: the thread takes all of the bore along its part and leaves only what lies above it, which must not be taken for the thread. The thread is listed on the bore as it was before the feature, down to where the cone meets the crest, (45 - 42.366) / 2 = 1.317 above the bottom."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F5", "def": {"type": "thread", "faces": [{"body": "F2.b0", "face": "F4:side(c1)"}],
